1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,215
“年纪越大，你越想
“As you get older,

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:03,960
把一些朋友留在身后。这很正常。”
you'll want to leave some friends behind. It's normal.”

3
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,936
出自 Tim Denning，简介
It's Tim Denning,

4
00:00:05,956 --> 00:00:09,210
自称 10 亿阅读、赚 600 万美元以上。
whose bio claims 1B+ views and $6M+ earned.

5
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,737
写这篇时，Tim 38 岁，
Tim wrote this at 38,

6
00:00:10,757 --> 00:00:12,490
有个 2 岁的女儿。
with a 2-year-old daughter.

7
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:14,787
原因：年轻时挑朋友是为了好看，
The reason: when you're young you pick friends to look good.

8
00:00:14,807 --> 00:00:17,570
后来不在乎好不好看了，朋友就换了。
Later you stop caring, and friends change.

9
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:19,416
Tim 举的例子：夜店里的朋友，
Tim's example: friends from nightclubs

10
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:21,320
能给免费的酒，能带你插队。
who get you free drinks and skip the line.

11
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,661
可 40 岁还想过 20 岁日子的人，
But someone at 40 still living like 20 is,

12
00:00:23,681 --> 00:00:25,650
在 Tim 眼里是原地踏步。
in Tim's eyes, standing still.

13
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,950
做法很温和：别粗暴断联，
The method is gentle: don't cut them off rudely,

14
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,650
慢慢少联系。
just slowly reduce contact.

15
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:30,891
第二条：生孩子，
Lesson 2: having kids,

16
00:00:30,911 --> 00:00:32,610
Tim 说是自由的起点。
Tim says, is where freedom starts.

17
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:34,352
20 岁时，有人对 Tim 说：
At 20, someone told Tim:

18
00:00:34,372 --> 00:00:36,470
生了孩子，你的人生就完了。
your life is over once you have kids.

19
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:38,137
2 岁的女儿占去大把时间，
A 2-year-old takes up lots of his time,

20
00:00:38,157 --> 00:00:40,270
Tim 却说这是一生最好的经历。
yet Tim calls it the best experience of his life.

21
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,786
孩子难，好东西都难。
Kids are hard, and so is everything good.

22
00:00:41,806 --> 00:00:43,840
Tim 的话：选你的难。
Tim's line: choose your hard.

23
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:46,417
第二十九条：陪父母，要比你觉得
Lesson 29: spend more time with your parents

24
00:00:46,437 --> 00:00:49,200
正常的更多，他们很快会走。
than feels normal. They'll be gone soon.

25
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,411
第三十二条却说：
Yet lesson 32 says:

26
00:00:50,431 --> 00:00:52,710
把父母给你定的人生计划烧掉。
set your parents' plan for your life on fire.

27
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:54,506
理由：世界变太快，AI
Why: the world moves too fast,

28
00:00:54,526 --> 00:00:58,060
时代的规则全被打破，要走自己的路。
AI has broken all the rules, so carve your own path.

29
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,251
不过这是 38 岁、
But this is the view

30
00:00:59,271 --> 00:01:00,785
有了孩子的人的视角，
of a 38-year-old father.

31
00:01:00,805 --> 00:01:02,940
20 多岁的你不必照搬。
If you're in your 20s, don't copy it.

32
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:05,190
朋友会换，父母不会等。
Friends change. Parents won't wait.
